///| `src/scp` -- the parts of `scp` that are rules rather than transport.
///
/// Loop #90.  Everything here is a pure function of the command line and
/// the path strings, so it can be tested on all four backends and
/// compared byte-for-byte against the real `scp.exe` without a peer.
///
/// ## Why this package exists at all
///
/// The driver in `cmd/scp` is allowed to translate between our error
/// types and the sentences OpenSSH prints; it is not allowed to decide
/// anything.  `scp`'s command line is a getopt string with a handful of
/// validators, and `is_remote()` is a two-line function that decides
/// which of the three copy paths a run takes.  Both are rules, so both
/// live here, where a unit test can pin them and where a mutation can
/// be aimed at one of them without touching the driver.
///
/// ## The three layers, and why they are three files and not one
///
/// * `args.mbt` / `spec.mbt` / `copy.mbt` / `msg.mbt` -- the rules: the
///   option table, the local-versus-remote split, the destination naming
///   and the measured sentences.  Every claim in them was read out of the
///   real binary (`.loop90/DESIGN.md`).
/// * `engine.mbt` -- the copy itself, written over two abstractions (a
///   `LocalFs` of six function values and an `@sftpdrive.SftpDrive`), so
///   the recursion, the `-p` handling and the failure ordering can be
///   tested with no filesystem and no peer, on all four targets.
/// * `localfs_native.mbt` / `localfs_stub.mbt` -- the only platform code:
///   Win32 wide-character file calls on native, and a refusal everywhere
///   else (`localfs.c` says why wide).
///
/// ## The measured claims this file encodes
///
/// The reference is the real binary on this machine (9.5p2); every table
/// below was read out of its behaviour by `.loop90/probe_optstring9.py`,
/// `probe_args7.py`, `probe_args8.py`, `probe_numspec10.py`,
/// `probe_scp_D5.py`, `probe_scp_D6.py`, `probe_scp_D7.py` and
/// `probe_scp_D8.py`, not copied from `scp.c`.
import {
  "moonbitlang/core/encoding/utf8",
  "openssh/openssh_moonbit/src/sftp",
  "openssh/openssh_moonbit/src/sftpdrive",
}

pkgtype(kind: "library")

options(
  native_stub: [ "localfs.c" ],
  targets: {
    "localfs_native.mbt": [ "native" ],
    "localfs_stub.mbt": [ "js", "wasm", "wasm-gc" ],
  },
)
